# Your family's data stays on your computer. These paths are never committed, so a fork or pull request cannot publish them.
kids/*.md
!kids/_template.md
inbox/*
!inbox/.gitkeep
maps/*/log/*
!maps/*/log/.gitkeep
maps/*/status/*
!maps/*/status/.gitkeep
spacing/state/*
!spacing/state/.gitkeep
cockpit/*-*.html
.DS_Store
